JiraImagesEvidence

JiraImagesEvidence is responsible for controlled evidence capture during execution. It creates the correct evidence folder structure, saves manual screenshots when requested, supports automatic failure screenshots, and helps keep each evidence file attached to the correct scenario in the final report. This is the correct file to update when you need to change screenshot naming, evidence folder rules, automatic failure capture, manual evidence behavior, or evidence association logic.
