JiraReportSteps

JiraReportSteps is responsible for creating the visible steps that appear in the custom eMatch report. It allows step by step test cases to explicitly write only the business readable actions that should appear in the final HTML, instead of depending on noisy raw Katalon execution lines. This is the correct file to update when you need to change the step marker format, the visible step writing strategy, or the controlled logging format used by the report.
