JiraIntegration

JiraIntegration is the entry point keyword used by the test case to start the Jira publishing flow. It exposes the import keyword and delegates the real processing to JiraFlowCoordinator. This is the correct file to update when you need to change the public keyword signature, the exposed entry method, or the integration start behavior used by the tests.
