ematchReport

ematchReport is the main listener used by the custom eMatch reporting flow. It supports execution timing capture, report metadata registration, step marker flow, and report related runtime information that is later consumed by the custom HTML report and Jira publishing process. This is the correct file to update when you need to change listener behavior, timing capture, step trace support, or report metadata collection during execution.
